  "question": {
    "text": "Two fixed frictionless inclined plane making an angle $30^{\\circ}$ and $60^{\\circ}$ with the vertical are shown in the figure. Two block $A$ and $B$ are placed on the two planes. What is the relative vertical acceleration of $A$ with respect to $B$ ?\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/394U4JMklIvKO5S9ArryVdR0k3JDmvrgsAmdGDblWd8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
